<title>FRANCE: Total boosts 1996 net dividend 21 pct.</title>
<headline>Total boosts 1996 net dividend 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>    Net dividend per shr (francs)   10.50    vs  8.70</p>
<p>Note - French oil company Total said in a statement there would be in addition a tax credit of 5.25 francs per share. It said it would not propose at the annual shareholders' meeting on May 21 to renew an option pay the dividend in the form of company shares. Given Total's strong balance sheet and level of cash flow, &quot;it is no longer necessary to increase the company's equity&quot;, it said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
